оё народное название оно получило из-за светового плафона на крыше, напоминающего медицинский шприц. Из-за «шприца» же возникла и легенда, что до войны в доме размещалась аптека. Сейчас здесь городская библиотека.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"ru:Сортавала","names":{"ru":"\"Дом со шприцем\" (Сортавала)"},"photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Sortavala_KirovaSq7_007_4760.jpg/1280px-Sortavala_KirovaSq7_007_4760.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Sortavala_KirovaSq7_007_4760.jpg/500px-Sortavala_KirovaSq7_007_4760.jpg","w":1200,"h":781,"author":"Ludvig14","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Sortavala_KirovaSq7_007_4760.jpg"}},{"id":"sortavala_wv_atelier_of_gogolev","areaId":"sortavala","name":"Atelier of Gogolev","category":"landmark","tags":["photo"],"location":{"lat":61.7011,"lng":30.6918},"visitMinutes":60,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"sortavala_wv_atelier_of_gogolev","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://kareliamuseum.ru/muzei-karelii/811/","official":true}],"signals":{"commonsNearby":104,"wikidataSitelinks":0,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-23"},"hashtags":["atelierofgogolev","sortavala"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"10:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"20:00"}]},"summary":"Exposition of woodcuts and wooden reliefs from private collection of Kronid Gogolev. Renowned local artist who toured extensively first in Soviet Union and later also in Scandinavia and Germany.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Sortavala","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Fire_station_in_Sortavala%2C_Karelia%2C_Russia_DSC01465-1.jpg/1280px-Fire_station_in_Sortavala%2C_Karelia%2C_Russia_